# SHIPPED GAME DATA - these must survive the blanket extension rules above.
#
# The extension list is repo-wide, so `git add` on an art directory silently
# drops a handful of files and reports success. rerelease/overrides/ staged 2839
# of its 2845 files that way; the six that vanished were all .png (baselt_a/b,
# reflt1_9/10, reflt3_9/10) and the release build shipped without them.
#
# The CI job in .github/workflows/build.yml uploads baseq2/ and rerelease/
# straight out of the checkout, so anything not committed is simply absent from
# the produced build. Untracked here means missing in the release.
#
# After staging any asset directory, diff it:
#   comm -13 <(git ls-files -- <dir> | sort) <(find <dir> -type f | sort)
!rerelease/overrides/**
